{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51538","headline":"题蔡处士居 · 唐廪","name":"题蔡处士居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一亩周旋几十家，舂轮相次好生涯。\n鹧鸪近晚啼深竹，鸂𪆟新晴立浅沙\n沃衍共知多黍稷，宽平仍觉富桑麻。\n当年何事抛耕钓，木笏蓝衫两鬓华。\n（以上《纯常子枝语》四十引《萍乡县志》（均见同治《萍乡县志》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐廪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}